キノコン布陣」のどこが良くてどこが悪いかなんて、なかなか分からないよな。","nextNodeIds":[735070306]},{"nodeId":735070306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30319,"speakerName":"バルフォア","textMapHash":2886561898,"text":"でも大丈夫だ。これからしばらくの間、俺とハニヤーさんはずっとここにいる。毎日一つずつ「チエキノコン布陣」の新しいステージを用意するつもりだ——合計七ステージをな。","nextNodeIds":[735070307]},{"nodeId":735070307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30319,"speakerName":"バルフォア","textMapHash":1116935698,"text":"時間があるときに来てくれれば、いつでも試遊できるぜ！","nextNodeIds":[735070308]},{"nodeId":735070308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30319,"speakerName":"バルフォア","textMapHash":4007067834,"text":"それから、君は主催側の最終決定権を握っているとは言え、このゲームは俺とハニヤーさんが勝手に準備したもので、君の計画に元々あったものじゃない。つまり、俺たちは君の時間をいただくってわけだ。","nextNodeIds":[735070309]},{"nodeId":735070309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30319,"speakerName":"バルフォア","textMapHash":446791722,"text":"だから、君には報酬を用意した！","nextNodeIds":[735070310,735070311]},{"nodeId":735070310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2249458930,"text":"ははっ、それじゃ遠慮なく！","nextNodeIds":[735070312]},{"nodeId":735070312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30319,"speakerName":"バルフォア","textMapHash":2977435850,"text":"ははは、率直だな！その豪気には感心するぜ！","nextNodeIds":[735070313]},{"nodeId":735070313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30318,"speakerName":"ハニヤー","textMapHash":1718803946,"text":"キノコンの仲間たちについても十分な滞留期間を申請したわ。「チエキノコン布陣」のテスト期間中、あの子たちはずっとオルモス港に居られる。","nextNodeIds":[735070314]},{"nodeId":735070314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30318,"speakerName":"ハニヤー","textMapHash":3988707466,"text":"「シルバー伴星」もポコポコビーニーとゆっくり遊べるわよ。","nextNodeIds":[735070315,735070316]},{"nodeId":735070315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":118658234,"text":"パイモンも喜ぶと思う！","nextNodeIds":[735070317]},{"nodeId":735070317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30318,"speakerName":"ハニヤー","textMapHash":1036775690,"text":"ふふっ、君も早くポコポコビーニーに会いに行ってあげて。あの子も君を恋しがってたんだから。","nextNodeIds":[735070318]},{"nodeId":735070318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30318,"speakerName":"ハニヤー","textMapHash":4284869146,"text":"そうだ、これを持っていってちょうだい。一緒に遊ぶとき、ポコポコビーニーや喜炎にあげるといいわ。あの子たちの大好物なの。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":735070316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2974192474,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}ももう待ちきれない！","nextNodeIds":[735070317]},{"nodeId":735070311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2538498906,"text":"次の大会の給料で埋め合わせするね！","nextNodeIds":[735070312]},{"nodeId":735070304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":384112098,"text":"もっとがっつり遊んでみないと。","nextNodeIds":[735070305]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7350703,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30319"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7350705,"order":6,"stepDescription":"キノコンの仲間と会話する","stepDescTextMapHash":2258543204,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7350705,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30321"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7350705],"talks":[{"